-- Chapter 1, Article 3 (ĐIỀU 3): temporary cover while an application is pending.
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are generated from line N of ../../source/raw/manulife-group-linked.txt.
--
-- The three layers: is the death covered (3.1 period, 3.1 Accident, 3.2 condition, 3.3
-- causes); how much (3.1, the lesser of the pending sums insured and 200,000,000, or the
-- premium where that exceeds 200,000,000); and to whom (the Beneficiaries named in the
-- application, src:280-281, which this group product does not otherwise have: finding X3).

§ `Article 3 — Temporary cover`
-- src:267 | ĐIỀU 3  BẢO HIỂM TẠM THỜI

§§ `Refusals this module gives`

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Article 3 does not say whether premium is refunded when no temporary benefit is payable` MEANS
    REFUSE "Article 3 does not say whether premium is refunded when no temporary benefit is payable"

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`3.3 gives no floor when the costs exceed the premium paid` MEANS
    REFUSE "3.3 gives no floor when the medical and underwriting costs exceed the premium paid"

§§ `Article 3.1 — the temporary cover period`

-- "from when the Company stamps confirmation that it has received the complete valid
-- application and has received the full first premium" — both, so the later of the two dates
-- (fork F29) —
-- "until the Contract Issue Date or the date the Company issues a postponement or a decline".
-- src:290-295 | Thời hạn bảo hiểm tạm thời là khoảng thời gian được…
-- src:293 | phí bảo hiểm đầu tiên. Thời Hạn Bảo Hiểm Tạm Thời sẽ
-- src:294 | chấm dứt vào Ngày Cấp Hợp Đồng hoặc ngày Công Ty
-- src:295 | ban hành văn bản tạm hoãn hoặc từ chối bảo hiểm.
@ref Article 3.1 (src:290-295)
GIVEN x IS A `A death during temporary cover`
GIVETH A DATE
`3.1 — the temporary cover period began on` x MEANS
    IF   x's `date the Company stamped receipt of the complete valid application` AT LEAST x's `date the Company received the full first premium`
    THEN x's `date the Company stamped receipt of the complete valid application`
    ELSE x's `date the Company received the full first premium`

-- Fork F5: the period includes the day it ends on ("chấm dứt vào", ends on that day).
@ref Article 3.1 (src:290-295)
GIVEN x IS A `A death during temporary cover`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`3.1 — under` x `, the temporary cover period includes` d MEANS
        d AT LEAST `3.1 — the temporary cover period began on` x
    AND CONSIDER x's `date the temporary cover period ended`
        WHEN NOTHING  THEN TRUE
        WHEN JUST end THEN d AT MOST end

§§ `Article 3.1 — Accident`

-- "an event or a continuous chain of events, objective, caused by the action of a sudden
-- external force or object on the body of the Insured Member and causing death ... it must be
-- the direct, sole cause, unrelated to any other cause of death".
-- src:296-302 | Tai Nạn là một sự kiện hoặc một chuỗi sự kiện liên tục,…
@ref Article 3.1, definition of Accident (src:296-302)
GIVEN x IS A `A death during temporary cover`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`3.1 — the death was caused by an Accident` x MEANS
        x's `an event or continuous chain of events, objective in nature`
    AND x's `caused by a sudden external force or object acting on the body`
    AND x's `the direct and sole cause of death, unrelated to any other cause`

§§ `Article 3.1 — the amount`

-- "the total Sum Insured of the main product on all pending applications of the same Insured
-- Member, or 200,000,000 dong, whichever is smaller."
-- src:272-276 | Công Ty sẽ chi trả một khoản tiền bằng tổng Số Tiền Bảo…
-- src:275 | Người Được Bảo Hiểm đó hoặc 200.000.000 (hai trăm
-- src:276 | triệu) đồng, tùy theo số nào nhỏ hơn. Công Ty sẽ thanh
@ref Article 3.1 (src:270-276)
GIVEN x IS A `A death during temporary cover`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`3.1 — the temporary benefit amount` x MEANS
    min (x's `total sum insured of the main product on all pending applications for this person`) 200_000_000

-- "However, if the total premium paid on all pending applications is greater than 200,000,000
-- dong, the Company will only refund the total premium paid, without interest." Strictly
-- greater: 200,000,000 exactly does not trigger it.
-- src:281-285 | Hưởng có tên trong hồ sơ yêu cầu bảo hiểm. Tuy nhiên,…
-- src:282 | nếu tổng phí bảo hiểm đã đóng của tất cả các hồ sơ yêu
-- src:283 | cầu bảo hiểm đang chờ cấp lớn hơn 200.000.000 (hai
-- src:284 | trăm triệu) đồng, Công Ty sẽ chỉ trả lại tổng phí bảo hiểm
-- src:285 | đã đóng, không có lãi. Thời hạn bảo hiểm tạm thời chỉ áp
@ref Article 3.1 (src:281-285)
GIVEN x IS A `A death during temporary cover`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`3.1 — the premium paid exceeds 200,000,000` x MEANS
    x's `total premium paid on all pending applications` GREATER THAN 200_000_000

§§ `Article 3.2 — the condition`

-- src:303-307 | Điều kiện áp dụng bảo hiểm tạm thời: quyền lợi bảo…
@ref Article 3.2 (src:303-307)
GIVEN x IS A `A death during temporary cover`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`3.2 — the standard-rate condition is met` x MEANS
    x's `would be accepted at the standard rate on the declared information`

§§ `Article 3.3 — the causes that turn the benefit into a refund`

-- src:308-319 | Quyền lợi bảo hiểm tạm thời nêu trên sẽ không có…
-- src:314 | a) Tự tử, dù trong trạng thái tỉnh táo hay mất trí; hoặc
-- src:315 | b) Các hành vi vi phạm pháp luật hình sự của Người
-- src:316 | Được Bảo Hiểm, Bên Mua Bảo Hiểm hoặc của Người
-- src:317 | Thụ Hưởng.
-- src:318 | c) Sự kiện dẫn đến tử vong của Người Được Bảo Hiểm
-- src:319 | xảy ra trước khi Thời hạn bảo hiểm tạm thời bắt đầu.
@ref Article 3.3 (src:308-319)
GIVEN x IS A `A death during temporary cover`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`3.3 — the death has a cause listed in 3.3` x MEANS
        "a)" ... x's `suicide, whether sane or insane`
    ..  "b)" ... x's `a criminal act of the Insured Member, the Policyholder or a Beneficiary`
    OR  "c)" ... x's `date of the event that led to death` BELOW `3.1 — the temporary cover period began on` x

-- The refund under 3.3: premium paid, without interest, less the medical costs and the costs
-- of assessing the risk that the Company paid. The document gives no floor (finding X10).
@ref Article 3.3 (src:308-313)
GIVEN x IS A `A death during temporary cover`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`3.3 — the refund` x MEANS
    IF   net AT LEAST 0
    THEN net
    ELSE `3.3 gives no floor when the costs exceed the premium paid`
    WHERE
        net MEANS x's `total premium paid on all pending applications` MINUS x's `medical and underwriting costs the Company paid`

§§ `Article 3 — the outcome`

-- In the order the Article reads: main product only (src:285-287); a death inside the period
-- (src:270); 3.3 overrides the benefit for its causes; otherwise only death by Accident is
-- covered, and only if 3.2 holds (fork F28: 3.2 is tested before the premium switch); then the
-- 200,000,000 premium switch; then the benefit,
-- with no refund of the premium paid (src:287-289).
-- src:285-289 | đã đóng, không có lãi. Thời hạn bảo hiểm tạm thời chỉ áp…
-- src:288 | hợp Công Ty chi trả quyền lợi bảo hiểm tạm thời, Công
-- src:289 | Ty sẽ không hoàn lại số phí bảo hiểm đã đóng.
@ref Article 3 (src:267-319)
GIVEN x IS A `A death during temporary cover`
GIVETH A `The outcome under Article 3`
`Article 3 — the outcome of a death during temporary cover` x MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT x's `cover applied for under the main product`
            THEN `no temporary benefit is payable`
        IF NOT `3.1 — under` x `, the temporary cover period includes` (x's `date of death`)
            THEN `no temporary benefit is payable`
        IF `3.3 — the death has a cause listed in 3.3` x
            THEN `a refund of the premium paid, without interest, of` (`3.3 — the refund` x)
        IF NOT `3.1 — the death was caused by an Accident` x
            THEN `no temporary benefit is payable`
        IF NOT `3.2 — the standard-rate condition is met` x
            THEN `no temporary benefit is payable`
        IF `3.1 — the premium paid exceeds 200,000,000` x
            THEN `a refund of the premium paid, without interest, of` (x's `total premium paid on all pending applications`)
        OTHERWISE `the temporary benefit, with no refund of premium, of` (`3.1 — the temporary benefit amount` x)

-- What becomes of the premium when no temporary benefit is payable for a death inside the
-- period: the Article is silent (finding X2).
@ref Article 3 (src:267-319)
GIVEN x IS A `A death during temporary cover`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 3 — the premium refunded` x MEANS
    CONSIDER `Article 3 — the outcome of a death during temporary cover` x
    WHEN `a refund of the premium paid, without interest, of` r     THEN r
    WHEN `the temporary benefit, with no refund of premium, of` b   THEN 0
    WHEN `no temporary benefit is payable` THEN
        `Article 3 does not say whether premium is refunded when no temporary benefit is payable`
